      attribution: "Augustin de Saint-Aubin after Jean-Baptiste Greuze, Portrait of Denis Diderot, 1766, engraving, The Metropolitan Museum of Art, Harris Brisbane Dick Fund, 1953 (53.600.189), public domain",
      attributionUrl: "https://www.metmuseum.org/art/collection/search/422999",
