      source: "Engraved portrait of Johann Heinrich Pestalozzi by Christian Forssell, dated 1814, after a painting by Jean Henriette Rath (print lettered 'Rath pinx.', 'Forssell sculp. 1814' and 'Pestalozzi, born 12 January 1746'), Rijksmuseum, Amsterdam, object RP-P-1908-2712. The file is the engraved image cropped from the museum's 4242 x 5602 pixel scan (1548 x 2015) and downscaled to 922 x 1200, with no upscaling and no retouching.",
